<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves rise to $3.55 bln to Nov 27.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves rise to $3.55 bln to Nov 27.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves rose to $3.552 billion as of November 27, from $3.499 billion on November 20.  </p>
<p>  HARD CURRENCY RESERVES Nov 27   Nov 20   Jan 3  Nov 30/95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)    3.552    3.499    3.424     3.046</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	 1.206    1.338    1.599     1.590</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector  4.757    4.838    5.024     4.636</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
